Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bob, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bob, I'm not out to cheat anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.96,0:00:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where that head has gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There are gaps in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.42,0:00:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Moments when I don't remember what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I swear I'm not trying to cheat anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.14,0:00:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the chance to find that head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise to do all I can to track it down.
